  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for the Promotion of Local Development in the Southern Region (ProSul)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Promocin del Desarrollo Local de la Regin Sur (ProSul)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es apoyar la resiliencia de la Regin Sur de Brasilfrente a la crisis post COVID-19 a nivel local en los estados de Paran, Rio Grande do Sul, y Santa Catarina. El objetivoespecfico del programa es aumentar el apoyo financiero al sur del pas en la fase de recuperacin de la crisis sanitaria yeconmica de COVID-19 en cuatro reas crticas: mercado laboral, turismo, salud y saneamiento.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to support the resilience of Brazil&apos;s South Region at the local level in the states of Paran, Rio Grande do Sul, and Santa Catarina amid the post-COVID-19 crisis. The specific objective is to boost the financial support for the country&apos;s south in the recovery phase from the COVID-19 health and economic crisis, in four critical areas: labor market, tourism, health, and sanitation.</narrative>
  </description>
